# SCOPE CONTROL

If a requested feature is outside MVP:

Do not automatically implement it.

Explain:

1. Why it is outside MVP.
2. Whether it blocks an MVP workflow.
3. The smallest MVP-compatible alternative.

Then wait for explicit approval.

---

# IMPORTANT

Do not add "nice to have" features just because they are easy to implement.

Correctness is more important than feature count.
